<% content_for :title, "Speak to the village office" %>
<%= render "shared/resident_header", household: @household %>
<%= render "shared/resident_menu", token: @household.token %>

<div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
  <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Speak to the village office</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
    For anything this page cannot do — adding or removing a member, changing what
    you have agreed to, correcting a payment, or a question about a request —
    speak to the village office in person.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 p-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
    <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Nyika Village Office</p>
    <p class="mt-1">Open weekday mornings.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
      The office keeps the details here up to date.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 p-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
    <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Your rights</p>
    <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>You can ask to see everything recorded about your household.</li>
      <li>You can correct anything that is wrong.</li>
      <li>You can withdraw any agreement you have given, at any time.</li>
      <li>Every change is recorded with who made it, when, and why.</li>
      <li>If your link has been seen by someone else, ask for a new one.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="pb-8"></div>
